# mbsync configuration — mailbox.org → ~/.mail/mailbox
# Copy to ~/.mbsyncrc and set User to your mailbox.org login address.
# Run: mbsync -a    to sync all channels
#      mbsync mailbox   to sync one channel

IMAPAccount mailbox
Host imap.mailbox.org
User you@mailbox.org
PassCmd "security find-internet-password -s 'mbox-imap' -a 'neomutt' -w 2>/dev/null | tr -d '\n'"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore mailbox-remote
Account mailbox

MaildirStore mailbox-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/mailbox/
Inbox ~/.mail/mailbox/INBOX

Channel mailbox
Far :mailbox-remote:
Near :mailbox-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
Expunge Near
SyncState *
